 and BOFU (Bottom of Funnel) focuses on converting interested prospects into paying customers.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458682207","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458682207","name":"7. How do I create a digital marketing funnel?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start by defining your goal and audience, then map out your funnel stages, create content for each stage, choose the right channels, set up lead capture, nurture leads with email automation, and track performance regularly.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458694891","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458694891","name":"8. What tools are used to build a digital marketing funnel?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Common tools include Google Analytics for tracking, Mailchimp or HubSpot for email automation, Meta Ads Manager for paid traffic, and landing page builders like\u00a0Unbounce\u00a0or\u00a0ClickFunnels\u00a0for conversions.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458717010","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458717010","name":"9. What is the difference between a linear funnel and a non-linear funnel?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A linear funnel follows a fixed, sequential path from awareness to\u00a0purchase. A non-linear funnel reflects modern buyer behavior, where customers can enter, exit, or jump between stages in any order.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458730190","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-funnel\/#faq-question-1782458730190","name":"10. How do I measure the success of my digital marketing funnel?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Track metrics like website traffic, click-through rate (CTR), lead conversion rate, cost per lead, and customer retention rate at each stage to\u00a0identify\u00a0drop-offs and\u00a0optimize\u00a0performance.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10060","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/16"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=10060"}],"version-history":[{"count":27,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10060\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21876,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10060\/revisions\/21876"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/20560"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=10060"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=10060"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=10060"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}